---
const palette = [
  { name: "Sage", hex: "#8F9E8B" },
  { name: "Beige", hex: "#E5D3B3" },
  { name: "Nude", hex: "#F2E2CE" },
  { name: "Dusty Rose", hex: "#D4A373" },
  { name: "Olive", hex: "#606C38" },
  { name: "Terracotta", hex: "#BC6C25" },
];
---

<section id="dress-code" class="py-20 px-4" data-animate="fade-up">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="script-font text-5xl md:text-6xl mb-4 text-wedding-dark-green">
      Código de Vestimenta
    </h2>
    <p class="font-serif-elegant text-lg md:text-xl text-wedding-gold tracking-widest mb-6 uppercase">
      Formal / Terraza
    </p>

    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-10 italic max-w-lg mx-auto text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed">
      Queremos que nuestras fotos reflejen la armonía de este día. 
      Les invitamos a vestir con nuestra paleta de colores inspirada en la naturaleza.
    </p>

    <!-- Paleta de colores -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 md:gap-5 mb-14" data-animate="scale-in">
      {palette.map((color, i) => (
        <div class="flex flex-col items-center group" style={`animation-delay: ${i * 100}ms`}>
          <div
            class="w-14 h-14 md:w-18 md:h-18 rounded-full shadow-md border-[3px] border-white group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300"
            style={`background-color: ${color.hex}`}
          />
          <span class="mt-2 text-[10px] md:text-xs uppercase tracking-tight text-gray-500 font-serif-elegant">
            {color.name}
          </span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Cards de sugerencias -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left">
      <div class="bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl border border-wedding-sage/15 shadow-sm" data-animate="fade-left">
        <h3 class="font-serif-elegant text-wedding-dark-green mb-4 flex items-center text-base md:text-lg">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2 text-wedding-gold" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
          </svg>
          Sugerencias
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-wedding-sage mt-0.5">•</span>
            Trajes en tonos claros o tierra para caballeros.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-wedding-sage mt-0.5">•</span>
            Vestidos midi o largos en tonos pasteles o mates.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-wedding-sage mt-0.5">•</span>
            Calzado cómodo para jardín/terraza.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-red-50/40 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-100/50 shadow-sm" data-animate="fade-right">
        <h3 class="font-serif-elegant text-red-800 mb-4 flex items-center text-base md:text-lg">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-5 w-5 mr-2 text-red-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
          </svg>
          Restricciones
        </h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-red-900/70 text-sm">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-300 mt-0.5">•</span>
            Evitar color <strong>blanco</strong> (exclusivo de la novia).
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-300 mt-0.5">•</span>
            Evitar rojos intensos o colores llamativos.
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-300 mt-0.5">•</span>
            Evitar neón o estampados muy cargados.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
